 | `CURRENCY_RE` | `/^[A-Z]{3}$/` | `api/src/domain/orders/validation.js` | Regex clients can pre-validate against to fail fast on the client side. |
+| `TENANT_PATTERN` | `/^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9_-]{1,62}$/` | `api/src/waitlist.js` | Regex clients can pre-validate tenant ids before calling waitlist endpoints. |
+| `EMAIL_PATTERN` | `/^[^\s@]+@[^\s@]+\.[^\s@]+$/` | `api/src/waitlist.js` | Lightweight server-side email validation used by the waitlist module. |
 
